      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Catalyst \u00b7 Fleet \u00b7 Install lifecycle\nTerminal outcomes and per-phase timing for the **catalyst.install / uninstall / reinstall** lifecycle (CTL-1369). Metrics come from the `catalyst_install_*` log\u2192metrics connectors in `collector-config.yaml`; the run feed is Loki `{service_name=\"catalyst.install\"}` with a per-run `trace_id` for the root-span Tempo jump.\n\n> **Ships ready-to-receive.** The install/updater install signals are **inert until adoption / install PR2** \u2014 until the first real install lands, every panel reads empty / `No data yet`. The **per-phase duration** panel is additionally **gated** on the `catalyst.install.phase_duration_ms` attribute (updater channel turn 11) and will stay empty until the install lib promotes it.\n\nUse **$node_class** to scope by node class, **$service** to scope the run feed, and **$bucket** to set the rate/histogram step."
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Total install/uninstall/reinstall terminal outcomes recorded in the selected range.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(catalyst_install_total{catalyst_node_class=~\"$node_class\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Install runs (range)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Share of runs ending in outcome=completed. Yellow < 95%, red < 80%.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 80
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 95
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent",
          "noValue": "No data yet"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(increase(catalyst_install_total{outcome=\"completed\",catalyst_node_class=~\"$node_class\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(catalyst_install_total{catalyst_node_class=~\"$node_class\"}[$__range])), 1)",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Success rate (range)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Runs ending in outcome=failed. Any > 0 warrants a look at the run feed below.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(catalyst_install_total{outcome=\"failed\",catalyst_node_class=~\"$node_class\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Failed runs (range)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Runs ending in outcome=rolled_back \u2014 the install aborted and reverted. Red at \u2265 1.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(catalyst_install_total{outcome=\"rolled_back\",catalyst_node_class=~\"$node_class\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Rolled-back runs (range)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Install terminal outcomes per $bucket, faceted by outcome. completed=green, failed=red, rolled_back=orange. Empty until the first real install lands (adoption / PR2).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No data yet"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "completed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "green",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "failed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "red",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "rolled_back"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "orange",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "width": 280
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (increase(catalyst_install_total{catalyst_node_class=~\"$node_class\"}[$__interval]))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "interval": "$bucket"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Install outcomes over time",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "p95 install phase wall time by phase (acquire, backup, write-config, install-agents, start-daemons, healthcheck \u2014 plus any uninstall/reinstall phases that appear). GATED: empty until the `catalyst.install.phase_duration_ms` attribute lands (see updater channel turn 11); built now so it lights up with no redeploy.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "auto"
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "No data yet (gated on phase_duration_ms)"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "max",
            "mean"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "width": 280
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (phase, le) (rate(catalyst_install_duration_seconds_bucket[$__interval])))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{phase}}",
          "interval": "$bucket"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Install phase duration p95 \u2014 GATED (empty until phase_duration_ms lands)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Run count by operation (install / uninstall / reinstall) over the selected range.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "noValue": "No data yet"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showValue": "auto",
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
